        <h2 class="h3 text-navy-900">Who we are</h2><p>{{ fortress('name') }} (“Fortress”, “we”) of 8 Desaine Street, St. Augustine, Trinidad &amp; Tobago operates this website and the recruitment platform at {{ url('/careers') }}.</p>
        <h2 class="h3 mt-8 text-navy-900">What we collect</h2><p><strong>Enquiries:</strong> name, company, email, phone, site location and your message, so we can respond and prepare a proposal.</p><p><strong>Job applications:</strong> contact details, date of birth, nationality, driver's permit class, precept / licence status, experience, education, CV and cover note. We also record the stage of your application, interview dates and recruiter notes.</p>
        <h2 class="h3 mt-8 text-navy-900">How we use it</h2><p>To assess your suitability for employment, carry out in-house background checks as described on our careers page, contact you about your application, and meet our obligations under the Private Security Industry regulations of Trinidad &amp; Tobago. Enquiry details are used only to respond to you.</p>
