        <h2 class="h3 mt-8 text-navy-900">Sharing &amp; security</h2><p>We do not sell personal data. CVs are stored outside the public web root and are accessible only to authorised recruitment staff. Data may be shared with vetting providers (e.g. polygraph) with your consent at the assessment stage.</p>
